<p>LABUAN  $20.26   $21.45  $21.38  $22.54  $23.94  $26.38  $25.54</p>
<p>MIRI    $20.21   $21.40  $21.33  $22.49  $23.89  $26.33  $25.34</p>
<p>DULANG  $19.29   $20.41  $20.35  $21.41  $23.08  $25.66  $24.55</p>
